                        "language": "english",
                        "review": "Mosaic maze is a precision platformer by Raw Lion Workshop\n\nThe first-impressions-video can be found here: https://youtu.be/rcE0fYFM-Ao\n\nHere are some points about the game:\n[list]\n [*]It gets really difficult really fast\n [*]No soundtrack, just soundbits\n [*]Bonus unlocks and variety mechanics keep the game engaging\n [*]Death can be unecessarilly punishing at times\n [*]Reset button to get out of softlock would be nice to have \n[/list]\n\nAll in all I am pleased with this game and would recommend it especially to those people who like to conquer a challenging platformer.",
